{"ref":"BDB, אִלּוּ","hw":"אִלּוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אִלּוּ</span></big>  <strong>conj. (</strong>often in Mishnah; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אִילּוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܠܘܽ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ࠀࠋࠅ</span>: from <span dir=\"rtl\">אִין</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܢ</span>, and <span dir=\"rtl\">לוּ</span><strong>) if, though</strong>, only in late Heb., <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 6:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.6.6\">Ec 6:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:4\" href=\"/Esther.7.4\">Est 7:4</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱלוּל","prev":"BDB, אַלִיַה"}